  "content": "<h1>Tim 核心</h1><p>v1.7.3-1.31</p><p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fcobblemon-tim-core\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Modrinth</a></p><p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/cobblemon-tim-core\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">CurseForge</a></p><p><a href=\"https://github.com/timinc-cobble/cobblemon-tim-core\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">GitHub</a></p><h2>如果…</h2><p>…我的 Cobblemon 模组能无需大量复制粘贴就能工作？</p><h2>功能特性</h2><p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.notion.so%252fAbstractMod-2fb57e0d4afd817b8612d3e4449956bf%253fpvs%253d21\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">抽象模组</a></p><p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.notion.so%252fAbstractConfig-2fb57e0d4afd816b8d8fcb15b09c0f8a%253fpvs%253d21\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">抽象配置</a></p><p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.notion.so%252fConfigBuilder-2fb57e0d4afd815385a0f62746dc3a32%253fpvs%253d21\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">配置构建器</a></p><p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.notion.so%252fOverridable-Options-2fb57e0d4afd811f8a10e56d2dad718e%253fpvs%253d21\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">可覆盖选项</a></p><p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.notion.so%252fAbstractHandler-2fb57e0d4afd813fb883fd539053be04%253fpvs%253d21\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">抽象处理器</a></p><p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.notion.so%252fDebugger-2fb57e0d4afd815c817de32f57e5c0be%253fpvs%253d21\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">调试器</a></p><p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.notion.so%252fPokemonExtensions-2fb57e0d4afd81a98ed6d0b2bfd56421%253fpvs%253d21\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">宝可梦扩展</a></p><p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.notion.so%252fEvents-2fb57e0d4afd81dd9c39d8c954a28420%253fpvs%253d21\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">事件系统</a></p><p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.notion.so%252fCustom-Pok-mon-Properties-2fb57e0d4afd81c4a4bed69179471d09%253fpvs%253d21\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">自定义宝可梦属性</a></p><p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.notion.so%252fHoldings-2fb57e0d4afd81aaa359e1948d19988e%253fpvs%253d21\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">持有物系统</a></p><p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.notion.so%252fExpAll-Logic-2fb57e0d4afd8195be3bd2ebbd5239b7%253fpvs%253d21\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">学习装置逻辑</a></p><p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.notion.so%252fSpawning-Buckets-Attachment-2fb57e0d4afd813c96f7cbb8e6924c16%253fpvs%253d21\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">生成桶附件</a></p><p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.notion.so%252fSpawn-Cause-Attachment-2fb57e0d4afd8126bf67e5f526098552%253fpvs%253d21\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">生成原因附件</a></p><p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.notion.so%252fPokemonMatcher-2fb57e0d4afd819180aee50ae705c795%253fpvs%253d21\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><code>宝可梦匹配器</code></a></p><p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.notion.so%252fResourceReloadListeners-2fb57e0d4afd810ba3fee0a59207e060%253fpvs%253d21\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><code>资源重载监听器</code></a></p><p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.notion.so%252fBlock-Item-Registration-2fb57e0d4afd81979b18e8fccc978a57%253fpvs%253d21\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">方块与物品注册</a></p><p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.notion.so%252fCommands-2fb57e0d4afd81ceb2adfc24b1377050%253fpvs%253d21\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">命令系统</a></p><p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.notion.so%252fLimited-List-2fb57e0d4afd81a28e56e48ee96857cf%253fpvs%253d21\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">限制列表</a></p><p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.notion.so%252fWild-Pok-mon-Reservation-System-2fb57e0d4afd814fb925ecc9593d9565%253fpvs%253d21\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">野生宝可梦预留系统</a></p><p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.notion.so%252fPokemonRepresentation-2fb57e0d4afd81c1881cd894f12b8854%253fpvs%253d21\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">宝可梦表现系统</a></p><p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.notion.so%252fBase-Cobblemon-Fixes-2fb57e0d4afd8147a428e845cd42b6d8%253fpvs%253d21\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">基础 Cobblemon 修复</a></p><p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.notion.so%252fPrevent-Spawns-2fb57e0d4afd8193b767d9023288b7c0%253fpvs%253d21\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">生成阻止</a></p><p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.notion.so%252fSpawning-Influences-2fb57e0d4afd8127a8c9c78fffb629fb%253fpvs%253d21\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">生成影响因素</a></p><p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.notion.so%252fCustom-Property-Extractor-2fb57e0d4afd819c9a21d526d7591634%253fpvs%253d21\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">自定义属性提取器</a></p><p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.notion.so%252fCodecs-2fb57e0d4afd81e49bc5d746c1c10c8b%253fpvs%253d21\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">编解码器</a></p><h2>玩家帮助</h2><p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.notion.so%252fConfig-Options-2fb57e0d4afd81d1ac7de074d314d790%253fpvs%253d21\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">配置选项</a></p><h2>依赖项</h2><ul>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.notion.so%252fCobblemon-22157e0d4afd80a49896c70a775a3c7f%253fpvs%253d21\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Cobblemon</a></li>\n</ul><h2>已知问题</h2><ul>\n<li>≤v1.7.1-1.29.0 版本中，<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.notion.so%252fLimited-List-27a57e0d4afd80b68ae3c0613e8e6ca7%253fpvs%253d21\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">限制列表</a> 在同时存在白名单和黑名单时使用了“或”逻辑。这意味着你可以通过白名单或者不通过黑名单，但这有些不合逻辑。你通常需要表达类似“所有电属性宝可梦，但排除拥有隐藏特性的”这样的条件，这要求同时满足白名单且不在黑名单中。该问题已在 1.7.1-1.29.1 版本中修复。</li>\n</ul><h2>开发路线</h2><p>如果你想了解模组的最新开发进展，请加入 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fdiscord.com%252finvite%252fWKAR27SdSv\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Discord 服务器</a> 并订阅相关频道的通知。你也可以在 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.notion.so%252fTim-Core-22057e0d4afd809b9c02e78f26805376%253fpvs%253d21\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">模组主页</a> 查看待办事项列表。</p><h2>反馈建议</h2><p>如果你对模组有任何疑问、建议，或者只是想打个招呼，欢迎来 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fdiscord.com%252finvite%252fWKAR27SdSv\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Discord 服务器</a> 找我们！</p><h2>支持我们</h2><p>如果我创作的内容让你感到愉快，或者帮助了你完成创作，欢迎 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fko-fi.com%252ftimsminecraftmods\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">请我喝杯咖啡</a>，如果愿意的话可以备注说明我是如何帮助你的！</p>",
